  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "You had better not "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "stay up"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " too late."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "你最好别熬夜太晚。"
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "stay up 是常考词组，常出现在保持句意基本不变的句型转换练习中，所以学生一定要知道：stay up 与 don’t go to bed 意思相同，在句中可以互换。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：Bill "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "stayed up"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " until he finished writing the letter at 11:45 last night."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= Bill "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "didn’t go to bed"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " until he finished writing the letter at 11:45 last night."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "比尔昨晚直到 11 点 45 分写完信才去睡觉。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
